qode (2.1.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * Windows: native build with ConPTY terminal (PowerShell, cmd, Git Bash, WSL), per-user installer and portable zip, both with or without Qt WebEngine
  * Help > QODE's Files: everything QODE created on this computer, with sizes; the Windows uninstaller lists and removes QODE's data
  * Text files keep their encoding (UTF-8, UTF-16, Windows-1252) and line endings; Reopen / Save with Encoding
  * Game panel (Ctrl+Alt+P): Teqris and Snake
  * Terminal asks before closing a tab with a running command; View menu grouped into submenus
  * Kotlin LSP pinned to 263.7084.0; Gradle 9.9.0 and Kotlin 2.4.21 in the templates; crash fixes on quit

 -- zahid4kh <halilzahid@gmail.com>  Tue, 10 Nov 2026 22:07:11 +0100

qode (2.0.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * QODE chat on Gemini or Claude: file, terminal, LSP, git and debugger tools, usage meter, codebase search, undo / redo, slash commands, MCP servers, Fix with QODE
  * Inline edit (Ctrl+K) and the Claude Code view (front end for the claude CLI)
  * Editor: multiple cursors, code lenses, Ctrl+click links, .editorconfig, local history, Copy as Image, C/C++ conveniences
  * JVM: Maven panel, Ktor support, JDWP debugger, New Kotlin / Java class, dependency manager
  * HTTP client for .http / .rest files, git diff pane, web / Expo preview
  * Three packages: qode (system Qt), qode-bundled (Qt 6.11 + WebEngine), qode-bundled-noweb

 -- zahid4kh <halilzahid@gmail.com>  Tue, 03 Nov 2026 21:59:30 +0100

